@startuml
title AgriDrone v3 - Result revision lifecycle (target)
[*] --> PendingReview
PendingReview --> ApprovedInternal : Manager freezes exact revision
ApprovedInternal --> PendingReview : Required source/review revision changed
ApprovedInternal --> AwaitingSettlement : Finalized invoice / Due > 0
AwaitingSettlement --> PendingReview : Approval/invoice dependency invalidated
AwaitingSettlement --> Published : Current approved revision / Due = 0
ApprovedInternal --> Published : Current finalized invoice / Due = 0
note right of ApprovedInternal
  Baseline / profiles may exist internally.
  Owner result content remains locked.
end note
note right of Published
  Atomic publication / unlock / durable notice
  PublishedAt = UnlockedAt = NoticeCreatedAt
  One original service value per Order
  Claim deadline: local D+8 00:00 exclusive
end note
Published --> Withdrawn : Verified error / authorized withdrawal
Published --> Superseded : Reviewed substantive replacement released
Withdrawn --> Superseded : Reviewed replacement released
note right of Superseded
  Keep original evidence and dependent source references.
  Replacement revision has its own notice/window.
  No additional service charge or second sale.
end note
Published --> Published : Cosmetic edit / no window reset
Published --> Published : Complaint refund / no reopened balance
Superseded --> [*]
@enduml
